#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:4
msgid "Debugging UDFs"
msgstr "调试 UDF"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:7
msgid "Viewing remote logs"
msgstr "查看远程日志"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:9
msgid ""
"View UDF execution logs in Logview. **StdOut** shows text printed by the "
"function, and **StdErr** shows errors and warnings. To record input, "
"intermediate values, or output, use ``print(..., flush=True)`` inside the "
"UDF so printed messages are written immediately."
msgstr ""
"UDF 的执行日志可以在 Logview 中查看。**StdOut** 显示函数打印的内容，**StdErr** "
"可用来查看错误和警告。需要记录输入、中间结果或输出时，可以在 UDF 中使用 ``print(..., "
"flush=True)``，让打印内容及时写入日志。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:14
msgid ""
"Find the DAG containing the UDF in Logview and click its **Detail** icon. "
"The next steps depend on the Sub DAG's execution engine: follow "
":ref:`udf_debugging_dpe` or :ref:`udf_debugging_mcsql` below. The navigation"
" screenshots were captured in the MaxCompute console's Logview, using this "
"example on each engine. Log text is shown below the code."
msgstr ""
"在 Logview 中找到包含 UDF 的 DAG，点击 **Detail** 图标。接下来根据 Sub DAG 的执行引擎，分别按下方的 "
":ref:`udf_debugging_dpe` 或 :ref:`udf_debugging_mcsql` 操作。导航截图来自 MaxCompute "
"控制台的用户版 Logview，分别运行了本页对应引擎的示例；日志文字列在代码下方。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:20
msgid "For the Logview hierarchy and controls, see :doc:`../general/logview`."
msgstr "Logview 的页面层级和操作方式见 :doc:`../general/logview`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:22
msgid ""
"The following example uses three orders to show how to find invalid input. "
"Order ``1002`` has the price ``\"invalid\"``, which cannot be converted to a"
" number. The function prints the input types, the number of invalid rows, "
"and up to three affected order IDs."
msgstr ""
"以三条订单为例：订单 ``1002`` 的价格是 "
"``\"invalid\"``，无法转换成数字。为了找出这条数据，示例在函数中打印输入类型、异常行数，以及最多三个异常订单 ID。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:94
msgid ""
"Set the connection environment variables before running the example. The "
"``option_context`` block disables automatic local execution so that "
"``execute`` submits this small sample and the UDF to the remote session. The"
" previous setting is restored when the block exits. Otherwise, if automatic "
"local execution is enabled, the sample can run on the client and its logs "
"will not appear in Logview. Open the printed Logview URL to inspect the "
"logs. If all three rows arrive in one call, StdOut contains lines like "
"these:"
msgstr ""
"运行前设置连接环境变量。``option_context`` 代码块暂时关闭自动本地执行，让 ``execute`` 将这份小样本和 UDF "
"提交到远端会话；退出代码块后恢复原设置。如果开启自动本地执行，小样本可能在客户端运行，日志就不会出现在 Logview 中。打开打印出的 Logview"
" 链接查看日志。如果三行数据在同一次调用中传入，StdOut 会包含以下内容："

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:109
msgid ""
"The engine can split the sample into several calls. This changes the "
"``rows`` and ``output_rows`` values and the number of log groups. Find the "
"call that reports ``sample_order_ids=[1002]``. The displayed dtypes can also"
" vary with the runtime's pandas version and data conversion. In the runs "
"shown here, ``price`` has dtype ``object``."
msgstr ""
"引擎可以把样本拆成多次调用，因此 ``rows``、``output_rows`` 的值和日志组数会变化。查找包含 "
"``sample_order_ids=[1002]`` 的那次调用即可。显示的数据类型也会随运行环境中的 pandas "
"版本和数据转换方式变化；这里展示的运行中，``price`` 的类型为 ``object``。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:115
msgid ""
"This example uses ``pd.to_numeric(..., errors=\"coerce\")`` to turn invalid "
"values into ``NaN`` and marks those rows with ``valid=False``. Orders "
"``1001`` and ``1003`` have totals of ``25.0`` and ``24.0``; order ``1002`` "
"has a total of ``NaN``. The invalid row is retained so it can be checked "
"later."
msgstr ""
"代码用 ``pd.to_numeric(..., errors=\"coerce\")`` 将异常值转成 ``NaN``，并将这一行标记为 "
"``valid=False``。因此，订单 ``1001`` 和 ``1003`` 的总额分别是 ``25.0`` 和 ``24.0``，订单 "
"``1002`` 的总额是 ``NaN``。这条异常订单仍保留在结果中，便于后续检查。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:123
msgid "DPE: Step and SubSteps"
msgstr "DPE：进入 Step 和 SubSteps 查看日志"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:125
msgid ""
"In **Sub DAG List**, select the Sub DAG containing the UDF, such as "
"``STAGE_1``. In **Instance of Sub DAG**, find the ``DPE SubDAG instance`` "
"row and click its **Detail** icon. This opens the DPE details in a new tab."
msgstr ""
"在 **Sub DAG List** 中选择 UDF 所在的 Sub DAG，例如 ``STAGE_1``。在下方的 **Instance of Sub"
" DAG** 列表中找到 ``DPE SubDAG instance``，点击这一行的 **Detail** 图标，在新标签页打开 DPE 详情。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:129
msgid "DPE SubDAG instance and its Detail icon in the MaxCompute console"
msgstr "MaxCompute 控制台中 DPE SubDAG instance 的 Detail 入口"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:129
msgid ".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/udf/dpe-subdag-entry.jpg"
msgstr ""
".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/udf/dpe-subdag-entry.jpg\n"
"   :alt: MaxCompute 控制台中 DPE SubDAG instance 的 Detail 入口"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:133
msgid ""
"Select the relevant Step in **Step List**. In its **SubSteps** list, find "
"the row whose **Description** contains ``DataFrameApplyChunk``. Open "
"**StdOut** or **StdErr** on that row. The read-table and write-table rows "
"have their own logs and do not contain this function's output."
msgstr ""
"在 **Step List** 中选择对应的 Step，然后在 **SubSteps** 列表中找到 **Description** 包含 "
"``DataFrameApplyChunk`` 的那一行，点击该行的 **StdOut** 或 "
"**StdErr**。读表和写表任务的日志中没有这个函数的打印内容。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:138
msgid "DataFrameApplyChunk row with StdOut and StdErr in DPE SubSteps"
msgstr "DPE SubSteps 中 DataFrameApplyChunk 任务的 StdOut 和 StdErr 入口"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:138
msgid ".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/udf/dpe-substeps-logs.jpg"
msgstr ""
".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/udf/dpe-substeps-logs.jpg\n"
"   :alt: DPE SubSteps 中 DataFrameApplyChunk 任务的 StdOut 和 StdErr 入口"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:142
msgid ""
"In **StdOut**, find ``invalid_rows=1, sample_order_ids=[1002]``. This "
"identifies the order with an invalid price. ``output_rows=3`` shows that the"
" function retains that order."
msgstr ""
"在 **StdOut** 中查找 ``invalid_rows=1, "
"sample_order_ids=[1002]``，可以定位到价格无效的订单。``output_rows=3`` 表示函数保留了这条订单。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:146
msgid ""
"This run has no retries, so **Rerun** is ``0``. When investigating a retried"
" task, check the task ID, status, and execution time to distinguish "
"attempts. For a DPE UDF that uses elastic memory, also check the SubSteps "
"**Description** column. A label such as ``[2.0x memory]`` means the task was"
" retried with twice its starting memory; it does not report measured peak "
"usage. Compare it with the failed attempt's logs to identify the OOM. See "
":ref:`udf_elastic_memory_observation` for an example screenshot."
msgstr ""
"这次运行没有重试，**Rerun** 为 ``0``。排查重试任务时，可以结合任务 ID、状态和执行时间区分各次尝试。如果 DPE UDF "
"使用了弹性内存，还需要查看 SubSteps 的 **Description** 列。``[2.0x memory]`` "
"表示重试时分配的内存是初始值的两倍，不是实测内存峰值。结合失败尝试的日志确认是否发生 OOM，示例截图见 "
":ref:`udf_elastic_memory_observation`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:154
msgid ""
"Ratios can be fractional, such as ``[2.5x memory]`` for 4 GiB expanded to 10"
" GiB."
msgstr "倍率也可以是小数，例如 4 GiB 扩到 10 GiB 时显示为 ``[2.5x memory]``。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:160
msgid "MCSQL: SQL job and Fuxi Instance"
msgstr "MCSQL：进入 SQL 子作业查看日志"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:162
msgid ""
"In **Instance of Sub DAG**, find the SQL job that runs the computation and "
"click its **Detail** icon. In this run, the job is described as ``Run SQL "
"for DISABLE_MCQA``. The ``TEMP_TABLE_CREATE`` entry only creates a temporary"
" table and does not run the UDF."
msgstr ""
"在 **Instance of Sub DAG** 中找到执行计算的 SQL 作业，点击它的 **Detail** 图标。本次运行中，这条记录的说明是 "
"``Run SQL for DISABLE_MCQA``。``TEMP_TABLE_CREATE`` 对应的记录只负责创建临时表，不会执行 UDF。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:167
msgid "SQL child jobs and their Detail icons in the MCSQL Instance list"
msgstr "MCSQL Instance 列表中的 SQL 子作业及 Detail 入口"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:167
msgid ".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/udf/mcsql-subdag-entry.jpg"
msgstr ""
".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/udf/mcsql-subdag-entry.jpg\n"
"   :alt: MCSQL Instance 列表中的 SQL 子作业及 Detail 入口"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:171
msgid ""
"In the SQL job's Logview, select the relevant **Fuxi Task** under **Fuxi "
"Jobs**. This example has one task, ``M1``. In **Fuxi Instance of Fuxi "
"Task**, open **StdOut** or **StdErr** for the worker, here ``M1#0_0``. Task "
"names and worker IDs can differ in other jobs."
msgstr ""
"进入 SQL 作业的 Logview 后，在 **Fuxi Jobs** 中选择对应的 **Fuxi Task**。本例只有一个任务 "
"``M1``，在下方的 **Fuxi Instance of Fuxi Task** 列表中，点击 ``M1#0_0`` 这一行的 **StdOut**"
" 或 **StdErr**。其他作业的任务名称和 Worker ID 可能不同。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:176
msgid "M1 worker with StdOut and StdErr in the SQL job's Fuxi Instance list"
msgstr "SQL 作业的 Fuxi Instance 列表中 M1 Worker 的 StdOut 和 StdErr 入口"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:176
msgid ".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/udf/mcsql-worker-logs.jpg"
msgstr ""
".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/udf/mcsql-worker-logs.jpg\n"
"   :alt: SQL 作业的 Fuxi Instance 列表中 M1 Worker 的 StdOut 和 StdErr 入口"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:180
msgid ""
"In **StdOut**, find the same three messages: ``rows=3``, ``invalid_rows=1, "
"sample_order_ids=[1002]``, and ``output_rows=3``. SQL runtime messages can "
"appear before and after the UDF output. **StdErr** was empty in this run."
msgstr ""
"在 **StdOut** 中查找相同的三条信息：``rows=3``、``invalid_rows=1, "
"sample_order_ids=[1002]`` 和 ``output_rows=3``。UDF 输出前后还可能出现 SQL 运行时日志。这次运行的 "
"**StdErr** 为空。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:188
msgid "Local Debug Mode"
msgstr "本地调试模式"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:190
msgid ""
"Local Debug Mode requires MaxFrame SDK 2.5.0 or later. With "
"``debug=\"local\"`` or ``debug=True``, the UDF runs in the local Python "
"process and can be stepped through with an IDE debugger. The following "
"example includes the connection and sample data; set the environment "
"variables before running it. See :doc:`../general/local_debug` for the "
"mode's setup and limitations."
msgstr ""
"本地调试模式需要 MaxFrame SDK 2.5.0 或更高版本。设置 ``debug=\"local\"`` 或 ``debug=True`` "
"后，UDF 会在本地 Python 进程中执行，可以使用 IDE "
"断点逐步调试。下面的示例包含连接配置和样例数据，运行前需要设置对应的环境变量。环境准备和使用限制见 "
":doc:`../general/local_debug`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:243
msgid ""
"In the IDE, set a breakpoint at ``result = chunk.copy()`` and start "
"debugging. Inspect ``chunk`` to check the input values and types."
msgstr ""
"在 IDE 中给 ``result = chunk.copy()`` 这一行打上断点，然后启动调试。程序停在断点时，先看 ``chunk`` "
"中的输入值和类型是否正确。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:245
msgid ""
"Step through the function and watch ``result[\"rate\"]``. Sales up to 5,000 "
"use ``0.05``, sales above 5,000 use ``0.10``, and sales above 10,000 use "
"``0.15``."
msgstr ""
"逐行执行，观察 ``result[\"rate\"]`` 的值：销售额不超过 5,000 时应为 ``0.05``，超过 5,000 时应为 "
"``0.10``，超过 10,000 时应为 ``0.15``。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:248
msgid ""
"Pause at ``return result`` and check the result values, columns, and dtypes."
" The expected commissions are ``250.0``, ``800.0``, ``1800.0``, and "
"``150.0``."
msgstr ""
"停在 ``return result`` 处，检查结果值、列名和数据类型。四条佣金的预期值为 "
"``250.0``、``800.0``、``1800.0`` 和 ``150.0``。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:252
msgid ""
"In PyCharm, select **View as DataFrame** for ``result`` to open the table "
"below. The debugger is paused at ``return result`` after all four columns "
"are computed."
msgstr ""
"在 PyCharm 中，点击 ``result`` 旁的 **View as DataFrame**，即可查看下图中的结果表。此时程序停在 "
"``return result``，四列数据均已计算完成。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:255
msgid ""
"PyCharm paused at return result, with sales, region, rate, and commission "
"for East, West, North, and South"
msgstr ""
"PyCharm 停在 return result，结果表显示 East、West、North、South 四行的 sales、region、rate 和"
" commission"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:255
msgid ".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/udf/local-debug-commission-breakpoint.jpg"
msgstr ""
".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/udf/local-debug-commission-"
"breakpoint.jpg\n"
"   :alt: PyCharm 停在 return result，结果表显示 East、West、North、South 四行的 "
"sales、region、rate 和 commission"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:259
msgid "After continuing past the breakpoint, the example prints:"
msgstr "继续执行断点后的代码，示例会打印以下结果："

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/debugging.rst:269
msgid ""
"Once the sample produces the expected result, run the function with a remote"
" session and real data. Local Debug Mode checks function logic; the remote "
"job still has its own input and package environment."
msgstr "样本得到预期结果后，再通过远程会话和真实数据运行函数。Local Debug Mode 用于检查函数逻辑；远程作业仍使用其自身的输入和依赖包环境。"
